{"version":1,"content":"<p>李尚正（阿正）與盧頌恩（妹頭）再度拍檔主持HOY旅遊節目《臥底旅行團6.0》於本月8日首播。</p><p>兩人繼續親身體驗不同類型旅行團，檢視低價行程的實際安排，今次更挑戰嚴寒、酷熱、登山及海上活動，當中包括39元三天團，以及橫跨澳洲與汶萊的7天行程。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T12:58:53.936952+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T12:31:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T13:18:27.435887+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T12:58:53.936952+00:00","content_hash":"6035ccf07fa8323c95d01b057dc0c03a45d2800edee53d666e8b9333353179d0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}